        {
          "title": "星宇股份就劝退应届生致歉",
          "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/zt_d/subject-1787793289",
          "published": "2026-08-31",
          "summary": "星宇股份就劝退应届生致歉",
          "source": "新浪"
